      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a73. Application and implementation. The Municipal Archives and Records Center will give technical assistance to any component of City government so that it may promptly, effectively and comprehensively apply the terms set forth in the appended Schedule to specific records maintained. Technical assistance includes recommendations on the establishment of filing systems and procedures compatible with the spontaneous and continuing application of the Schedule, preparation of disposal lists and requests for approval by the Board of Estimate, preparation of initial and annual listings of records scheduled for transfer to the Municipal Archives and Records Center, and the formulation of special instructions for the maintenance and disposition of records.",
